  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mali CP 2017-2022 TP 2 Decentralisation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve Democratic and Inclusive Governance through the strengthening of citizens&#x2019; participation and improved public services at local level.

Following the recommendations of the mid-term review in December 2019 and the redirection of support to the ministry in charge of decentralization, the framework for the results of the DED MATDRE was revised in March 2021. To this end, the initial indicators will stop in 2020 and the new indicators will cover 2021 and 2022.</narrative>
  </description>
